Other levers: renegotiate or consolidate suppliers on dairy and packaging, since that's the bigger bucket; forward-contract or hedge beans instead of riding spot; reformulate portion sizes and cup specs; shift mix toward higher-margin items; smaller, more frequent price moves rather than one jump; and attack the 2-point overhead drift.
